    "description": "System Location Co.,Ltd. provides business support for finance companies in Japan and internationally. The company offers solutions for auto lease, new and used car sales support, car rental, parking lot, publishing, credit, automobile maintenance, EC site, and insurance business . It also provides SYSROCKET, a SaaS solution package for auto finance businesses; CA Doctor, a sales support system for automobile dealerships; CAV Monitor, a solution that provides bulk calculation of car asset value; RV Doctor, a residual value setting system; PV Doctor, a present value calculation tool; Truck RV Doctor, a truck residual value calculator; vehicle catalog database, which consolidate database and information. The company was formerly known as Dormant Company Pine Co., Ltd. and changed its name to System Location Co.,Ltd. in July 1992. System Location Co.,Ltd. was incorporated in 1968 and is based in Tokyo, Japan."
